# web/kb/markers.json is a hand-edited, canonical source file (see
# web/kb/markers.README.md and README.md's "marker/fluorophore dictionary" note --
# there is no generator; it is edited directly). It still needs stable line
# endings: with no .gitattributes, Windows checkouts under core.autocrlf=true
# silently rewrite it to CRLF on checkout, which would make hand-edits noisy
# diffs and could confuse any future byte-for-byte tooling -- force LF so the
# file's bytes are stable on every platform.
web/kb/*.json text eol=lf
